ns.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Arkhangelsk_P7151205_2200.jpg"}},{"id":"arkhangelsk_wv_klub_koleso","areaId":"arkhangelsk","name":"Клуб «Колесо»","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":64.55304,"lng":40.51802},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"arkhangelsk_wv_klub_koleso","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.arkoleso.ru/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["клубколесо","arkhangelsk"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Старейший музыкальный клуб Архангельска. Специализируется на рок-концертах самой разной стилистики, которые проходят несколько раз в неделю. Выступают местные и иногородние (иногда иностранные) группы достойного уровня. Бывают также тематические вечеринки. Практикуется предварительная бронь столиков. Кухня незамысловатая, но кормят вкусно, цены демократичные, официанты приветливые. Забавный интерь","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Архангельск"},{"id":"arkhangelsk_wv_m33","areaId":"arkhangelsk","name":"«М33»","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":64.53267,"lng":40.60001},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"arkhangelsk_wv_m33","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.m33.ru/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["33arkhangelsk","arkhangelsk"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Крупнейший развлекательный комплекс города, единственный в своем классе. 2 танцпола, боулинг, бильярд, игровые автоматы, роллердром, несколько баров и ресторан. Хорошие кондиционеры. Есть детская комната. Местные жители называют комплекс и «эм-тридцать-три», и «эм-зе-зе» — по настроению.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Архангельск"},{"id":"arkhangelsk_wv_treskoed","areaId":"arkhangelsk","name":"Treskoed","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":64.53328,"lng":40.53509},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"arkhangelsk_wv_treskoed","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.treskoed.ru/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["treskoedarkhangelsk","arkhangelsk"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"An authentic restaurant of traditional Arctic fish cuisine. Menu includes Russian and Norwegian dishes, the prices are reasonable, and all information is accessible in English and Norwegian.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Arkhangelsk"},{"id":"arkhangelsk_wv_biblio_cafe","areaId":"arkhangelsk","name":"Biblio-cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":64.53863,"lng":40.51808},"visitMinutes":75,"photoSeed":"arkhangelsk_wv_biblio_cafe","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["bibliocafearkhangelsk","arkhangelsk"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A nice caffeterie in the heart of the city. Shared with a library and performed with old books and writers' portraits on walls. Lovely place for a cup of coffee.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","